DESCRIPTION:SQL Server 2008 for Developers \n\nwith Mladen Prajdic \n\nTues
	day June 16th 1:00pm EST\n\nWhat should developers know about database des
	ign so they don't have performance and logical problems?\n\nWhat's new in 
	SQL Server 2008 that helps solve some business problems that sometime requ
	ired "hacking" before.\n\nConcurrency design models and isolation levels.\
	n\nLive Meeting Information\nAttendee URL: https://www.livemeeting.com/cc/
	usergroups/join?id=MGWF7G&amp\;role=attend&amp\;pw=2mqPKT%3E%3FH <https://
	www.livemeeting.com/cc/usergroups/join?id=KFD4KC&role=attend> \nMeeting ID
	: MGWF7G\n\n\n
